#: ../../source/docs/common-hires-mag-array.rst:5
#: 9099bb6c6b234b88a34b686e9c8f8cd6
msgid "DroneCAN Magnetometer Array"
msgstr "DroneCAN 磁力计阵列"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hires-mag-array.rst:7
#: 4b0249fe96a0463fbc7556924afa685d
msgid ""
"ArduPilot can be used to create a multiple magnetomer array using DroneCAN "
"compasses. This could be useful as a suspended device for geophysical "
"surveys or other uses."
msgstr "ArduPilot 可使用 DroneCAN 罗盘创建多磁力计阵列。这可用于地球物理调查或其他用途的悬挂设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hires-mag-array.rst:9
#: ade2ddc7bce546e5a30d96f88dd3169f
msgid ""
"An ArduPilot autopilot (used only for the array logging, not for vehicle "
"control) could support many DroneCAN compasses as shown below:"
msgstr "一个 ArduPilot 飞控（仅用于阵列日志记录，而非飞行器控制）可支持多个 DroneCAN 罗盘，如下图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-hires-mag-array.rst:13
#: 6f1a59013f9e4314acaf7d985567125d
msgid "And could be suspended below a vehicle as shown below:"
msgstr "可以悬挂在飞行器下方，如下图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-hires-mag-array.rst:17
#: ccae5f6d925f46b986254b0ba1d8d8a9
msgid ""
"*image courtesy of* `AerialVision <https://www.aerial-vision.com.au>`__"
msgstr "*图片由* `AerialVision <https://www.aerial-vision.com.au>`__ *提供*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hires-mag-array.rst:19
#: 7f82c8f34b02461ba8890f788f04ea3f
msgid ""
"Each compass would have its raw x/y/z field readings logged by the MAGH "
"message."
msgstr "每个罗盘的原始 x/y/z 磁场读数将由 MAGH 消息记录。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hires-mag-array.rst:21
#: a8bc7f70ac304ea6af7d42e82f2d1e0e
msgid ""
"This capability is not included by default and would have to be included in "
"a custom build for the autopilot using the `Custom Firmware Build Server "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__ and enabling the \"DroneCAN HiRes "
"compasses for survey logging\" option under **Compass**."
msgstr ""
"此功能默认不包含，需要使用 `自定义固件构建服务器 <https://custom.ardupilot.org>`__ 构建自定义固件，并在 "
"**Compass** 下启用 「DroneCAN HiRes compasses for survey logging」 选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hires-mag-array.rst:23
#: 937c93bca9f94de481939cec5c3f0c99
msgid ""
"The autopilot would need to have :ref:`LOG_DISARMED<LOG_DISARMED>` parameter"
" set to log as soon as power is supplied."
msgstr "飞控需要将 :ref:`LOG_DISARMED<LOG_DISARMED>` 参数设置为在接通电源时立即开始记录日志。"
